{
  "id": "361",
  "title": "I'm Hungry",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-09-06",
  "synopsis": "Lili is getting hungry and asks Ben to buy hot dogs.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/516/623089e6d848d61a9bc8ba26aa2ee30875a71b48.mp3?1589791669",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 3: Who is Little Yu?",
    "chapter": 24,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "好饿啊\n\n丽丽：好饿啊！我们还有几块钱？\n本：5块。\n丽丽：那可以买两个热狗了。我们吃热狗吧！\n本：这个钱是用来坐公共汽车的。\n丽丽：都怪你，刚才为什么要去星巴克？咖啡能吃饱吗？\n本：是谁出门不带钱包的？\n丽丽：好吧……都怪我。",
    "traditional": "好餓啊\n\n麗麗：好餓啊！我們還有幾塊錢？\n本：5塊。\n麗麗：那可以買兩個熱狗了。我們吃熱狗吧！\n本：這個錢是用來坐公共汽車的。\n麗麗：都怪你，剛才為什麼要去星巴克？咖啡能吃飽嗎？\n本：是誰出門不帶錢包的？\n麗麗：好吧……都怪我。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’m hungry"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：好饿啊！我们还有几块钱？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：好餓啊！我們還有幾塊錢？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hǎo è a wǒ men hái yǒu jǐ kuài qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I’m hungry! How much money do we have left?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：5块。",
      "traditional": "本：5塊。",
      "pinyin": "běn 1 kuài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: 5 yuan."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那可以买两个热狗了。我们吃热狗吧！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那可以買兩個熱狗了。我們吃熱狗吧！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà kě yǐ mǎi liǎng ge rè gǒu le wǒ men chī rè gǒu ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Then we can buy two hot dogs. Let’s eat hot dogs!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：这个钱是用来坐公共汽车的。",
      "traditional": "本：這個錢是用來坐公共汽車的。",
      "pinyin": "běn zhè ge qián shì yòng lái zuò gōng gòng qì chē de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: This money is for the bus."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：都怪你，刚才为什么要去星巴克？咖啡能吃饱吗？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：都怪你，剛才為什麼要去星巴克？咖啡能吃飽嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì dōu guài nǐ gāng cái wèi shén me yào qù xīng bā kè kā fēi néng chī bǎo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: It’s all your fault, why did you have to go to Starbucks? Can coffee satisfy your hunger?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：是谁出门不带钱包的？",
      "traditional": "本：是誰出門不帶錢包的？",
      "pinyin": "běn shì shéi chū mén bú dài qián bāo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Who didn’t bring their wallet with them out?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：好吧……都怪我。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：好吧……都怪我。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hǎo ba dōu guài wǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Alright… It’s my fault."
    }
  ],
